# Phone plan comparison

| Plan | Data | Minutes | SMS | Price / month |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| current prepaid bundle | 30 GB | 1,000 | 1,000 | PKR 1,450 |
| postpaid 1,299 | 25 GB | 1,500 | 1,500 | PKR 1,299 + tax |
| student bundle | 50 GB (night 20 GB) | 500 | 500 | PKR 999 |

Student bundle wins if the night data counts for the updates. Need the university card to activate.
